OL,3,GNEWSAReturn of full maternity services
OL,4,Ain Moray delayed to next year
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe restoration of full maternity
OL,7,Fservices at Dr Gray's Hospital in Elgin
OL,8,Fhas been delayed until next year.
OL,10,FMaternity services at Dr Gray's were
OL,11,Fdowngraded in 2018 due to staff
OL,12,Fshortages, meaning most expectant
OL,13,Fmothers in the area had to travel to
OL,14,FAberdeen or Inverness for births.
OL,16,FThe aim had been to have a full
OL,17,Fconsultant-led maternity service by the
OL,18,Fend of this year.
OL,20,FNHS Grampian has now said it will
OL,21,Finstead be done "as soon as is safely
OL,22,Fpossible" next year.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
